#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:145
msgid "Anti-Aliasing"
msgstr "Anti-Aliasing"

#: imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:146
msgid ""
"<p>Enable this option to process anti-aliasing filter to the sheared image. To "
"smooth the target image, it will be blurred a little."
msgstr ""
"<p>Active esta opción para procesar un filtro de anti-aliasing (suavización) "
"para suavizar a imaxe inclinada. Cando a suavice, a imaxe quedará lixeiramente "
"difuminada."

